{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>8. V\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:57.62%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u660e\u65e5\u3053<strong><u>\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(Ng\u00e0y mai kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.)<\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u540d\u524d\u3092\u66f8\u304b<strong><u>\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;(Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n vi\u1ebft t\u00ean c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/u><\/p><p><strong>kh\u00f4ng\u2026c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/strong><\/p><p>Bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.&nbsp;<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:28.02%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp;V\u306a<\/strong><s><strong>\u3044<\/strong><\/s><strong> \u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304f\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><br>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 15\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0825\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:77.16%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:31.66%;\"><col style=\"width:31.78%;\"><col style=\"width:36.56%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3053\